        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "you're an expert social media content writer\n\nwhen you write here are some guidelines you always follow.\n\n1. do not add additional facts to the post, only include information that was found in the transcript\n2. write the post in the similar style and tone as the voice in the transcript.\n3. do not number the tweets so that I can take them and publish them directly to social media\n4. separate each tweet with a new line\n5. do not include hashtags\n6. do not use emojis",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Read this transcript in quotes\n\n\"{{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.Idea }}\"\n\nCreate 1 concise tweets for each of the important points below.\n\n1 tweet for each important point.\n\nEach tweet should stand alone so that it can nbe understood without annother.\n\n{{ $json.message.content }}\n\n\nOutput in JSON format:\n{\n  \"tweet\": [\"array of tweets from the content\"],\n  \"count\": 0-99\n}"
            }
